# The init a product runs when its product.env says INIT=openrc: mica-openrc boots the floor under openrc-init
# (DATA grown with sfdisk, busybox ifupdown, ntpd and syslogd, the watchdog, the health gate) and mica-mdev keeps
# /dev with busybox mdev; openrc and fdisk are the upstream roots of the Base lock
# (mica-system-base:docs/floor-and-options.md, "The init").
mica-openrc
mica-mdev
openrc
fdisk
